This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

It is a mutation battery behind a shipped fixture: the battery behind `apply-self-overwrite`.
It edits copies of the distribution's own `core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/apply.sh`, which a
consumer is denied editing, and its runtime is why the arms and the mutants are separate
directories. It sources `apply-self-overwrite/lib.sh`, so it scores the predicates the shipped arms run.
